{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a traditional jrpg game, turn-based with unique moments and a fascinating story focused on the purple light\u2019s past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story: </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thays Tanari, a 17-year-old Parasite hunter, joins her twin sister, Dunar Moonsong \u2014 the only Purple Light who survived in the universe. Together, they explore a dimension called Dimension Two and discover that they must find the five elements within it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, the story of the game focuses on Dunar Moonsong and tells the story of the Purple Light, a creature that lived long ago on the Planet of Lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtwo, the game\u2019s villain, loves to watch the world around him from the top of Zhenya\u2019s Palace. He orders Zhenya Zarele to awaken the Locusts to destroy the intruders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frances Schefer, Dunar Moonsong, and Thays Tanari join forces to fight evil and face the fury of Subtwo established in Dimension Two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because the war is not over\u2026 this battle is not for anyone.<br>This is the battle of the Purple Light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tOver 30 hours of gameplay; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t3 worlds with many regions to explore;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tFemale characters to play;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tMonster bestiary to complete;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tTurn-based battles;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tTrade your items with NPCs;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tTwo gameplay mechanics to play. Thays and Dunar are playable in this game.;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tColorful environments;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t1 bloody environment; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tOver 1 hour of soundtrack;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tRich story and many dialogues;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tEach city has your own unique NPCs. This game doesn\u2019t repeat NPCs;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tTwo endings to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1319530?t=1774669622","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1319530?t=1774669622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1319530/eb525767a3dfb73a024ed75daac950ba29b2f52d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774669622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1319530/eb525767a3dfb73a024ed75daac950ba29b2f52d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774669622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1320640,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a traditional jrpg game, turn-based with unique moments and a fascinating story focused on the purple light\u2019s past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story: </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thays Tanari, a 17-year-old Parasite hunter, joins her twin sister, Dunar Moonsong \u2014 the only Purple Light who survived in the universe. Together, they explore a dimension called Dimension Two and discover that they must find the five elements within it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, the story of the game focuses on Dunar Moonsong and tells the story of the Purple Light, a creature that lived long ago on the Planet of Lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtwo, the game\u2019s villain, loves to watch the world around him from the top of Zhenya\u2019s Palace. He orders Zhenya Zarele to awaken the Locusts to destroy the intruders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frances Schefer, Dunar Moonsong, and Thays Tanari join forces to fight evil and face the fury of Subtwo established in Dimension Two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because the war is not over\u2026 this battle is not for anyone.<br>This is the battle of the Purple Light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tOver 30 hours of gameplay; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t3 worlds with many regions to explore;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tFemale characters to play;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tMonster bestiary to complete;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tTurn-based battles;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tTrade your items with NPCs;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tTwo gameplay mechanics to play. Thays and Dunar are playable in this game.;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tColorful environments;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t1 bloody environment; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tOver 1 hour of soundtrack;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tRich story and many dialogues;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tEach city has your own unique NPCs. This game doesn\u2019t repeat NPCs;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tTwo endings to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Thistom Studios Software"],"dlc":[4384160],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1319530/d28a3adc09cba35bb86f4e729bb5a9c2169ee4dd/header.jpg?t=1774669622","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2026 Thistom Studios Software,